      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>Sea hag of the Drowned Past; daughter of Bavlorna Blightstraw of Hither and one of the Three who rule Coven Cove. A gaunt, drowned thing of the shore: greenish-gray skin, black kelp hair, eyes like coins in bilge water, barnacles crusting her rags like armor. She is the coven's rememberer, keeper of the debt-ledger, and she prices locations, not things. While the coven circle is dead she has no Shared Spellcasting and no Hag Eye; everything else works, and she is never more than a Brine Step from deep water.</p>",
        "public": ""
      },
      "source": {
        "custom": "Coven Cove GM Guide",
        "revision": 1,
        "rules": "2014"
      }
